00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.920
ok, we'll do this tomorrow

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.340
They are indeed.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.320
You're holding this one upside down.

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:04.800
