00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.400
(Spencer: one more, there you go, thats the same way)

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.620
(Cmike: How long did it take you to find that piece?)

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:15.580
Ugh, it took me weeks to find that piece

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:20.760
no, its stable

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.200
(Wren: nice)

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.400
(Wren: Uhh, thats odd)

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:29.480
