00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.080
let me look at it

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.920
Oh no
(Spencer: Well, they're reversed over here too)

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:37.020
Oh, hold up, hold up, hold up, hold up

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.460
(Spencer: Red is going to)

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:40.600
Oh, you're right

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:41.760
(laughs)

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:45.480
(Spencer: Well, its reversed reversed, so that means its going the right way at the end)

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.420
No, I'm going to fix that

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:51.100
You're right, I connected that wrong, ok, let me just double check all of these now

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.900
(Wren: The flat side of the XT60 has to be positive)

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.540
