00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:04.160
(All: yes)

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:06.860
(Spencer: Uh ok, we ca- [snap])

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:07.620
(snap)

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.040
(snap)

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.500
Well whatever, I did it

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.040
