00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:16.640
I'm super paranoid about this now, but it looks correct
(Wren: Yeah, that matches up)

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.340
(Wren: Flat is red, red flat)

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.580
we're getting 19.6 to 19.5 volts

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:27.240
(Spencer: So the computer is on right now, and we are at 62% on battery on the inside of it)

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.040
Kay

