00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:45.600
(Spencer: There's no other laptop with that type of connector in the back of it)

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:48.720
This is the only one that pulls that much voltage, and with this kind of connector

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:50.340
(Cmike: Could you turn off that fan?)

