So I got the laptop working at full power when its not plugged in to the wall.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.960
Its pulling all the electricity from this battery

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:47.880
And I've tricked the laptop into thinking that this battery and this system is actually house power basically running into the laptop

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:51.080
So nothing is being downclocked, everything is running at full power

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.020
