Uh, I feel like the first man in space

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:32.540
Ryan Gosling, the first man in space

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.880
I feel relief that it's working, and I've got plenty of improvement to do to this rig.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:37.640
I want to have it so that its like hanging up there

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:44.500
When its time for us to record VR games, I can just walk up, hit play, close the laptop, put it on, and then like strut into the middle of the room

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.940
